            {
                "entry_id": "3970279e-52fe-33e4-8e82-9a8d99a15290",
                "word": "steaming",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "15c9aa86-94da-42c3-8279-4bed7d74464d",
                        "entry_id": "3970279e-52fe-33e4-8e82-9a8d99a15290",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "steamings"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3a2e8c08-5db0-3725-a39b-e0028bb5c2ce",
                        "entry_id": "3970279e-52fe-33e4-8e82-9a8d99a15290",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The action of steam on something."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2ddbdb2-21eb-42bd-ae08-0762ebddc996",
                                "sense_id": "3a2e8c08-5db0-3725-a39b-e0028bb5c2ce",
                                "text": "Steaming is fine for this fabric, as long as you keep the iron moving."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3281b8f9-70ed-3128-b148-56dfd4fbdd46",
                        "entry_id": "3970279e-52fe-33e4-8e82-9a8d99a15290",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The method of cooking by immersion in steam."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "15a232e2-10b6-47fc-aeb3-338cb8014759",
                                "sense_id": "3281b8f9-70ed-3128-b148-56dfd4fbdd46",
                                "text": "Their favorite way to cook clams is steaming."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "88cc881c-75dc-327d-91ba-04850c0ce6dd",
                        "entry_id": "3970279e-52fe-33e4-8e82-9a8d99a15290",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act or process of seafaring under steam power."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ea12bd2d-44d6-4df8-8d69-7e8931d82971",
                                "sense_id": "88cc881c-75dc-327d-91ba-04850c0ce6dd",
                                "text": "Steaming was their preferred way to travel until airliners came along."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "83347d60-eff3-34bb-a350-edefe6b1ccd2",
                        "entry_id": "3970279e-52fe-33e4-8e82-9a8d99a15290",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The raising of steam by a steam locomotive etc; the maintenance of a head of steam during operation; (metonymic) operation under load."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b5c111cc-d82b-4c25-a81d-11ddd273fbda",
                                "sense_id": "83347d60-eff3-34bb-a350-edefe6b1ccd2",
                                "text": "Two 4-4-0s were steaming through the scenic foothills, giving rides to tourists."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f13e91e-c951-4127-91b0-1bb50417afeb",
                                "sense_id": "83347d60-eff3-34bb-a350-edefe6b1ccd2",
                                "text": "The response to firing is remarkable, and though the 280 lb. pressure seems more in the nature of a reserve for emergencies than a continuous working figure, even with the present-day apology for coal it seldom fell below 250 lb., and could always be brought up to blowing-off point with little difficulty. To this liveliness of steaming the thermic syphons are doubtless the chief contributory."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ed1793e6-d222-4e9c-ab81-7a6901da7744",
                                "sense_id": "83347d60-eff3-34bb-a350-edefe6b1ccd2",
                                "text": "The perfect steaming and beautiful mechanical condition of the Pacific were immediately apparent."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "84d6d172-aeec-3623-b37c-92aa63446190",
                        "entry_id": "3970279e-52fe-33e4-8e82-9a8d99a15290",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A form of robbery in which a large gang moves swiftly and violently through a bus or train."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK",
                            "countable",
                            "informal",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
